{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22674","headline":"酬和元九东川路诗十二首 南秦雪 · 白居易","name":"酬和元九东川路诗十二首 南秦雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁曾爲西邑吏，惯从骆口到南秦。\n三时云冷多飞雪，二月山寒少有春。\n我思旧事犹惆怅，君作初行定苦辛。\n任赖愁猨寒不叫，若闻猨叫更愁人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}